+# Broadcom sources consulted
+
+Accessed 2026-08-15 using live network research.
+
+- [Upgrade of Aria Operations 8.18.6 or 8.18.7 to VCF Operations 9.0.x is Unsupported](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/438994) — selected a greenfield VCF Operations 9.0.2 cluster, export/import of dashboards, super metrics, views and reports, and explicit abandonment of historical time-series data.
+- [Import and upgrade VMware Aria Automation 8.x to VCF Automation 9.0](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/433806/import-and-upgrade-vmware-aria-automatio.html) — placed the Automation transition after VCF Operations/Fleet Management and required import as an integrated instance before upgrade.
+- [Essential Prechecks for a Successful VCF Automation Upgrade](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/389563) — validated the estate's vSphere and NSX-T Policy accounts and enforced the gate excluding unsupported NSX-V and NSX-T manager-mode accounts.
+- [Upgrade Guidance for Aria Operations for Logs 8.18.x to VCF Operations for Logs 9.0.x](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/402314) — selected parallel greenfield deployment, integration reconfiguration and the 90-day log-data transfer limit.
+- [Update Sequence for VCF 9.0 and Compatible VMware Products](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/390634/update-sequence-for-vcf-90-and-compatibl.html) — ordered VCF Operations before VCF Automation and the fresh VCF Operations for Logs installation, captured the Aria Suite Lifecycle Patch 2 prerequisite, and retained Identity Manager 3.3.7 under Aria Suite Lifecycle 8.x management.
+- [VCF Operations 9.0 Sizing Guidelines](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/397782) — used the pinned large-node HA Operations profile, medium Logs profile and production Logs cluster minimum.
+- [Planning a Successful VMware Cloud Foundation 9.0 Deployment](https://blogs.vmware.com/cloud-foundation/2025/07/28/planning-a-successful-vmware-cloud-foundation-9-0-deployment/) — checked the HA deployment model and VCF Automation planning inputs; the pinned snapshot supplies the estate-specific MEDIUM_HA values.
+- [Aria Operations Management Pack for Storage Devices Not Displaying Storage Version Metrics in 8.18.5 and Unavailable for Download from Broadcom Marketplace](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/429591/aria-operations-management-pack-for-stor.html) — abandoned the EOGS Storage Devices 8.12 pack and selected native VCF Storage Operations.
+- [End of General Support for VMware Aria Operations 8.18](https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/422643) — recorded the 2027-10-11 Aria Operations support boundary.
+- [VMware Product Lifecycle](https://support.broadcom.com/group/ecx/productlifecycle) — checked the source release-family lifecycle boundaries represented in the pinned snapshot.
